msgstr "Untuk menyalin istilah dengan metadata mereka, silakan tingkatkan ke pro."

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:752
msgid ""
"With PublishPress Taxonomies Pro, you can duplicate taxonomy terms along "
"with all their metadata. This includes term descriptions, images, and "
"custom fields. You can copy terms between taxonomies to maintain consistent "
"organization across your site."
msgstr ""
"Dengan PublishPress Taxonomies Pro, Anda dapat menduplikasi istilah "
"taksonomi beserta semua metadata mereka. Ini termasuk deskripsi istilah, "
"gambar, dan bidang kustom. Anda dapat menyalin istilah antar taksonomi "
"untuk mempertahankan organisasi yang konsisten di seluruh situs Anda."

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:799
msgid ""
"Choose the display formats of your terms, options include table list, "
"ordered list, border-cloud and lots more."
msgstr ""
"Pilih format tampilan dari istilah Anda, opsi termasuk daftar tabel, daftar "
